{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev_value_bc",
    "description": "Diffusive flux through ONE DOMAIN FACE of column_nonuniform_1d, computed from the consumer-supplied boundary VALUE: G = K_face (u_adj - u_bc) / (z_adj - z_bc), the same interface-flux law as stencils/interface_flux_K_lev with the boundary value in the outer slot (uL <- u_bc and zc[n-1] <- z_bc). A pointwise match-less template: the caller supplies the adjacent cell value u_adj (at the layer centre z_adj) and the face coefficient K_face (K[1] at the surface face, K[NLEV+1] at the top face), so one formula serves both ends of the column. Positive in the +lev direction. Applied by rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_value_bc at the surface face (u_bc = u_sfc, z_bc = z_sfc, u_adj = u[1], z_adj = zc[1], K_face = K[1]) and at the top face (u_bc = u_top, z_bc = z_top, u_adj = u[NLEV], z_adj = zc[NLEV], K_face = K[NLEV+1]), and applied directly by consumers that read a domain-face diffusive flux (e.g. a basal conductive flux -G_top). `zc` is the consumer's free-name layer-centre observed and z_sfc / z_top the domain-face coordinates (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/grid.esm).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:interface_flux",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:2"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.13 (nonuniform grids)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "../grid.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "interface_flux_K_lev_value_bc": {
      "params": ["u_bc", "u_adj", "K_face", "z_bc", "z_adj"],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          "K_face",
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": ["u_adj", "u_bc"]
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": ["z_adj", "z_bc"]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
